# Start project

Version-Timestamp: {{ version_timestamp }}

1. Read the initial brief and inspect existing files without reorganizing them. Identify source authority, missing inputs and sensitive locations.
2. Complete context/INDEX.md, confirm scope and define the first milestone.
3. Configure real quality requirements in QUALITY.md. Report missing tool or global policy prerequisites explicitly.
4. Save a checkpoint with actual findings using checkpoint-project.md, then verify resume-project.md recovers them.

Do not create a remote repository, publish or install a plugin as a side effect of initialization.
